# 本地模拟接口示例；可在支持 .http 的 REST 客户端中逐条运行。
# 必须已有可信的本机模拟服务；只先运行第 1 条，人工检查 HTTP 200、版本和三个模拟标志。
# 全部符合才逐条运行 2–6；不要一次 Run All。本客户端文件不自动执行门禁。
# 每次运行前将 sid 改成新 ID；请勿输入真实用户或健康数据。
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8000/sim/v0
@sid = manual_change_me_01
@user = manual_sim_user

### 1. 检查 0.3.x-draft（当前 0.3.0-draft）、simulation=true、real_model=false、delivery=false
GET {{base}}/meta

### 2. 创建模拟会话；如 409，请更换新 sid
POST {{base}}/sessions
Content-Type: application/json

{"user_id":"{{user}}","session_id":"{{sid}}"}

### 3. 待确认时提交模拟事件；期望 200 pending_confirmation
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sid}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"event":{"schema_version":"0.1","event_id":"manual_event","event_type":"set_completed","user_id":"{{user}}","session_id":"{{sid}}","set_id":"set_1","exercise_id":"squat","timestamp":"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z","source":"simulation"},"do_not_disturb":false}

### 4. 重复同一事件；期望 200 duplicate_event
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sid}}/events
Content-Type: application/json

{"event":{"schema_version":"0.1","event_id":"manual_event","event_type":"set_completed","user_id":"{{user}}","session_id":"{{sid}}","set_id":"set_1","exercise_id":"squat","timestamp":"2026-11-03T00:00:00Z","source":"simulation"},"do_not_disturb":false}

### 5. 不存在的模拟会话中明确报告不适；期望 400，报告未记录
POST {{base}}/sessions/ghost_not_registered/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"answer","question_id":"q1","answer":"reported"}

### 6. 已存在会话中缺少 question_id 的明确不适信号；期望 400，报告未记录
POST {{base}}/sessions/{{sid}}/questions
Content-Type: application/json

{"operation":"answer","answer":"reported"}
